        "text_TiTchX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Kelsey Selby came to Luna Nueva as an </h4><h4>insider to the life the brand was built for.</h4>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 30
          }
        },
        "text_eazntk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Growing up in a household where good food and drink were celebrated nightly — seasonal ingredients, considered wine pairings, a table that was always set with intention — she developed an early understanding of hospitality and the specific pleasure of a room where everything feels right.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_fQTJrB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>She spent her years in Los Angeles deepening it: specialty grocers and farmers markets, the best restaurants in the city, an ongoing education in what makes people feel well taken care of. A good life, she learned early, is built around great food, great drinks, and the people you share them with.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
