    "custom_rich_text_columns_P6dhUJ": {
      "type": "custom__rich-text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_gR3pDg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>An act of hospitality.</h4>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_dFcrhE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That instinct is what she brought to Luna Nueva. Knowing the bartender’s name, making sure everyone at the table feels it, caring for the people who drink this brand — that has always been an act of hospitality for her.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": true,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_Qwajrx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What she saw was that her generation lived differently, chose differently. They are selective. And when they decide to drink, they want something that feels unmistakably theirs: clean, additive-free, made with real craft, and belonging to the culture they actually live in.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": true,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "media_TR33z4": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image_one": "shopify://shop_images/ev-longtable_b76b3703-9ff7-4ecd-8268-e0c5cda3a4e7.jpg",
            "image_one_caption": "",
            "image_mask": "rounded-corners",
            "position": "left",
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "text_kepgX7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Built from the ground up.</h4>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": false,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "right",
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_367phy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>She spent the last several years building Luna Nueva from the ground up: learning the liquid, cultivating the relationship with the Vivanco family distillery in the Highlands of Jalisco, and creating a presence in Los Angeles through community, events, and genuine belonging.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": true,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "right",
            "margin_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_d9EpKC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Luna Nueva is the first expression of a larger vision — one that sits at the intersection of hospitality, food, craft, and gathering. The tequila is where it begins, but the life it belongs to is much larger than a bottle.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "subheading": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "enable_fade": true,
            "enable_primary_font": true,
            "position": "right",
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "media_qyfTHH": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image_one": "shopify://shop_images/ev-fruitbar.jpg",
            "image_one_caption": "",
            "image_mask": "rounded-corners",
            "position": "right",
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
